 "description": "Ranked list of regions by a housing metric. sort_by=\"value\" (default) ranks by the latest value: metric=zhvi direction=top \u2192 most expensive metros, direction=bottom \u2192 cheapest. sort_by=\"growth\" ranks by percent change over a trailing window (growth_window_months, default 12): direction=top \u2192 FASTEST-GROWING / fastest-appreciating metros, direction=bottom \u2192 biggest decliners. metric defaults to zhvi (home values). Returns up to 100 rows.",
 "inputSchema": {
